								</svg>
								<span><strong>Semantic SEO Approach</strong>: Target hundreds of related keywords with single pieces of content</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-start">
								<svg class="h-6 w-6 svc-ic mr-3 mt-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
